    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Choose one of the following damage types: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder. You and your allies have Resistance to it while in your Aura of Protection. At the start of each of your turns, you can change the damage type to another of these options (no action required).</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-1slzlqY1PQ7FRltv\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Turn on the effect of the chosen damage type (only one).</p></section>",
